@* 익명 인증 페이지 공통 카드 셸 (Login/Register 와 동일한 ames-auth 디자인) *@
<div class="ames-auth-page">
    <div class="ames-auth-bg-grid"></div>

    <div class="ames-auth-card">
        <div class="ames-auth-brand">
            <div class="ames-auth-logo">A-MES</div>
            <div class="ames-auth-sub">OFFICE WEB@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(Sub) ? "" : " · " + Sub)</div>
        </div>

        @ChildContent
    </div>

    <div class="ames-auth-foot">A-MES · SEOYON E-HWA · 2026</div>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public string? Sub { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
